Order: #CA-3301 (Ordered: Matte Black Headphones / Received: Neon Green)
Customer Message: ''I opened the box and received neon green headphones instead of matte black. How does your warehouse mess up something so simple?''

What is the appropriate customer resolution?', '', '[{"id": 1, "text": "Neon green is actually our newest model, maybe give it a try?"}, {"id": 2, "text": "I apologize for our warehouse mix-up, James. You ordered Matte Black and that is exactly what you should have received. I have just generated a prepaid return shipping label for the green unit and placed a priority re-shipment for the Matte Black model at no extra cost."}, {"id": 3, "text": "Please return the item at your own shipping expense and we will refund when it arrives."}, {"id": 4, "text": "Warehouse mistakes happen all the time; wait for next batch."}]'::jsonb, 'Easy', 2.0, 60, 1, 'Active', '2026-08-20 13:59:34.479677', '2026-09-06 10:38:10.554625') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
