Conclusion: Which statement is strictly valid?', NULL, '["All squares are polygons", "All polygons are squares", "Some polygons are not rectangles", "No rectangles are squares"]'::jsonb, 'Medium', 2.0, 60, 1, 'Active', '2026-08-23 03:40:44.094656', '2026-09-08 14:32:02.386295') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
